# Set SITE_URL in the build environment for public canonical/social/schema URLs.
# SITE_URL=https://your-site.example
# Configure deployment base/slash/output policy in src/config/routing.ts.
# Without SITE_URL, URL-dependent metadata is omitted; preview URLs are not public defaults.
# This static profile has no database or CMS secrets.

# Optional Content-Security-Policy (scripts/static-csp.mjs): the build hashes every
# inline script and style into one site-wide policy in dist/_headers. Start with
# report (blocks nothing), check a preview deployment, then enforce. CSP_SOURCES
# adds third-party origins, for example "frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com".
# CSP_MODE=report
# CSP_SOURCES=
